hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1938","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Arqam (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik safar mein niklay, jis mein logon ko, khanay aur peenay ki, bohat takleef hui. Abdullah bin Ubayy, munafiq, ne apne saathi munafiqon se kaha ke: Tum un logon ko jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas hain, kuch mat do, yahan tak ke wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas se bhaag niklein. Zuhair ne kaha ke ye us shakhs ki qiraat hai jis ne min haulahu padha hai, aur yehi qiraat mashhoor hai aur qiraat-e-shaaz min hawlahu hai, yani yahan tak ke bhaag jayein wo log jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke gird hain. Aur Abdullah bin Ubayy munafiq ne kaha ke: Agar ham Madina ko lautein ge to albatta izzat wala, yani mardood ne apne aap ko izzat wala qarar diya, zillat walay ko nikaal de ga, yani mardood ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko zillat wala qarar diya. Phir main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko us ki khabar di. To Aap ne Abdullah bin Ubayy ko bulwaya aur us se poocha to us ne pakki qasam khayi ke main ne aisa nahi kiya aur kaha ke Zaid ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se jhoot bola. To mere dil mein un ke kehnay se sakht ranj hua yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne meri tasdeeq mein Surah Munafiqoon utari. (Muslim). (Minhawlahu mashhoor qiraat hai.) Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein apne liye maghfirat ki dua ke liye bulaya, lekin unhon ne apne sar mor liye, yani na aaye, aur Allah Taala ne un ke haq mein farmaya hai ke: Goya wo lakriyan hain deewar se tikayi hui. Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wo log zaahir mein khoob aur achay maloom hotay thay. (Muslim: 8/119-120). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke istighfar se munafiqon ka munh morna."
"1939","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kaun shakhs Marar ki ghaati par charh jata hai ke us ke gunah aisay maaf ho jayein jaisay Bani Israeel ke maaf ho gaye thay. Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke sab se pehle us ghaati par hamaray ghoray charhay yani qabeela Khazraj ke logon ke, phir logon ka taar bandh gaya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se har aik ki bakhshish ho gayi magar laal, surkh, oont walay ki nahi. Ham us shakhs ke paas gaye aur ham ne kaha ke chal Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tere liye maghfirat ki dua karein. Wo bola ke Allah ki qasam! Main apni gumshuda cheez paon to mujhe tumharay saahib ki dua se zyada pasand hai. Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wo shakhs apni gumshuda cheez dhoondh raha tha, wo munafiq tha jabhi Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki dua se mehroom raha. (Muslim: 8/123). Baab: Munafiqon ka zikr aur un ki alamat."
"1940","[AI-translation] Qais bin Ubaad kehtay hain ke main ne Ammar bin Yasir se poocha, aur Ammar bin Yasir jang-e-Siffeen mein Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf thay, ke tum ne jo larai, Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ki taraf se, ki, ye tumhari raye hai ya tum se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us baaray mein kuch farmaya tha? Agar raye hai to raye to durust bhi hoti hai aur ghalat bhi hoti hai. To Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham se koi aisi baat nahi farmayi jo aam logon se na farmayi ho, aur Ammar (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke beshak meri ummat mein, rawi-e-hadees Shuba kehtay hain ke mera khayal hai unhon ne ye kaha tha ke mujhe Huzaifa ne bayan kiya aur doosray rawi Ghundar kehtay hain ke unhon ne haddasani Huzaifa ke alfaaz nahi kahay, baarah munafiq hain jo jannat mein daakhil na hon ge aur na us ki khushbu payein ge yahan tak ke oont sui ke naakay mein daakhil ho jaye. (Muslim) Un mein se aath ko tum se aik dabeela, phora, kaafi ho jaye ga, yani un ki maut ka sabab banay ga, yani aik aag ka chiraagh un ke kandhon mein zaahir ho ga aur un ke seenon ko torta hua nikal aaye ga. Yani us phoray mein aik angara ho ga jaisay chiraagh rakh diya ho, Allah Taala Musalmanon ko mehfooz rakhay. Aameen. (Muslim)."
"1941","[AI-translation] Abu Tufail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Uqba ke logon mein se aik shakhs aur Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ke darmiyan kuch jhagra tha jaisay logon mein hota hai. Wo bola ke main tumhein Allah ki qasam deta hun ke Ashaab-e-Uqba kitnay thay? Is se murad wo munafiqeen hain jo ghazwa-e-Tabook ke safar ke dauran aik ghaati mein Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko nuqsan pahunchanay ke liye ikathay hue thay, Allah Taala ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un ke sharr se mehfooz rakha. Logon ne Huzaifa se kaha jab wo poochta hai to us ko bata do. Unhon ne kaha ke hamein, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, khabar di jati thi ke wo chaudah aadmi thay. Agar tu bhi un mein se hai to wo pandrah thay. Aur main qasam se kehta hun ke un mein se baarah to Allah aur us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke duniya aur aakhirat mein dushman thay aur baaqi teenon ne ye uzr kiya, jab un se poocha gaya ke ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munadi ki aawaz nahi suni aur na hamein maloom hua ke qaum ne kya irada kiya tha. Aur wo harra mein thay to wo chala, Aap ne farmaya ke Ae Allah! Un par lanat kar. (Muslim). (Asal mein iza hai; ashaab-e-uqba se murad Tabook wali ghaati hai, mashhoor baiat wali Uqba nahi; aaira se murad hairan ghumna hai.) Aur baaqi teenon ne ye uzr kiya, jab un se poocha gaya aur malamat ki gayi, ke ham ne to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke munadi, ke Uqba ke rastay se na aao, ki aawaz bhi nahi suni aur na us qaum ke irada ki ham khabar rakhtay hain. Aur, us waqt, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) pathreeli zameen mein thay. Phir chalay aur farmaya ke, aglay parao par, pani thora hai, to mujh se pehle koi aadmi pani par na jaye. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wahan tashreef le gaye to kuch, munafiq, log wahan pahunch chukay thay to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us din un par laanat farmayi. (Muslim: 8/123). Baab: Munafiq ki misaal do rewarhon ke darmiyan bhatakti bakri."
"1942","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misaal us bakri ki hai jo do gulon yani do rewarhon ke darmiyan maari maari phirti ho, kabhi us rewarh mein aati ho aur kabhi us mein. (Muslim: 8/125). Baab: Munafiq ki maut par sakht hawa chalna."
"1943","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik safar se wapas aa rahay thay, jab Madina ke qareeb pahunchay to aisay zor ki hawa chali ke sawaar zameen mein dabnay ke qareeb ho gaya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye hawa kisi munafiq ke marnay ke liye chali hai. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Madina pahunchay to munafiqon mein se aik bara munafiq mar chuka tha, ye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aik muajiza tha. (Muslim: 8/124). Baab: Qayamat ke din munafiq ka sakht azaab."
"1944","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik aadmi ki iyadat ki jis ko bukhar aa raha tha. Main ne us par apna haath rakha aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam! Main ne aaj ki tarah kisi shakhs ko itna sakht garam nahi dekha, bukhar ki shiddat ki wajah se us ka jism sakht garam tha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya kya main tum se us shakhs ke baaray mein bayan na karun jo qayamat ke din us se bhi zyada garam ho ga? Wo ye donon sawaar hain jo peeth mor kar ja rahay hain, ye do aadmiyon ke baaray mein jo ke us waqt Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahabiyon mein se thay. Ye is liye farmaya ke wo donon munafiq thay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke nifaaq se baakhabar thay. (Muslim: 8/124). (Mauook se murad bukhar zada hai; muqaffiyain se murad peeth moray hue hain.)"
"1945","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamari qaum Bani Najjar mein se aik shakhs tha jis ne Surah Baqarah aur Aal-e-Imran padhi thin aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye likha karta tha. Phir wo bhaag gaya aur ahl-e-kitab se mil gaya. Unhon ne us ko uthaya, yani us ki aao bhagat ki, aur kehnay lagay ke ye Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka munshi tha. Wo log us ke mil janay se khush hue. Phir thoray dinon mein Allah Taala ne us ko halaak kiya to unhon ne us ke liye qabr khodi aur dafna diya. Subah ko dekha to us ki laash bahar pari hai. Phir unhon ne garha khoda aur us ko dafan kar diya. Phir subah ko dekha to us ki laash bahar pari hai. Phir garha khod kar us ko dafan kar diya. Phir subah ko dekha to us ki laash ko zameen ne bahar phaink diya. Aakhir us ko yunhi para hua chhor diya. (Muslim). (Manbooz se murad phenka hua hai.)"
